// Title: Eventlog Cleared
// ID: a62b37e0-45d3-48d9-a517-90c1a1b0186b
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2017-01-10
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.005, car.2016-04-002
// Description: One of the Windows Eventlogs has been cleared. e.g. caused by "wevtutil cl" command execution
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(EventID = "104") AND where(Provider_Name = "Microsoft-Windows-Eventlog")) AND NOT (((where(Channel = "Microsoft-Windows-PowerShell/Operational") OR where(Channel = "Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational") OR where(Channel = "PowerShellCore/Operational") OR where(Channel = "Security") OR where(Channel = "System") OR where(Channel = "Windows PowerShell")))))
